{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>ויקרא</b> — like \"He commanded\"; the decrees that He decreed upon everything are by means of a call." "<b>על הארץ</b> — the land of Canaan."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 105, :notes {0 "The Hebrew הכל is translated hyper-literally as 'everything'; the syntax is compressed and possibly elliptical."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:38:25.178907515Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}